[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22561.59, "timestamp": "06:16:01", "text": "三位客人的接待工作。還剩兩場"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22595.27, "timestamp": "06:16:35", "text": "。  嗯，是的。晚上10:30然後凌晨 2 點，也就是午夜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22596.59, "timestamp": "06:16:36", "text": "我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22601.19, "timestamp": "06:16:41", "text": "天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22606.67, "timestamp": "06:16:46", "text": "所以，從某種意義上來說，我現在要休息一下了，10點10分30秒再見。我吃完晚餐就回來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22616.868, "timestamp": "06:16:56", "text": "我去休息一下"}]